WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
A plain recipe form — local state only, nothing shared yet.

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.500
Ask the agent to list the current ingredients.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.400
The agent reads the shared state through the DSH gateway.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.100
One click asks the agent to write the recipe.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.160
STATE_SNAPSHOT events rewrite the form: title, ingredients, steps.
